      "content": "i just got off a 14 hour shift and i'm sitting in my car in the parking lot just... i can't even turn the engine on. i feel like i've spent the last decade just trying to patch up holes in a dam that is clearly meant to break. it feels so pointless. like, what is even the point of it all?",
